<script setup lang="ts">import { computed, onMounted, ref } from "vue"; import { staffSession } from "../../auth/session"; import { listStores, type Store } from "../../admin/api"; import { listItems, type Item } from "../api"; const items = ref<Item[]>([]); const stores = ref<Store[]>([]); const storeId = ref(""); const query = ref(""); const error = ref(""); const filtered = computed(() => items.value.filter((item) => `${item.sku} ${item.name}`.toLowerCase().includes(query.value.toLowerCase()))); async function load(): Promise<void> { try { items.value = await listItems(storeId.value || undefined); } catch (reason) { error.value = (reason as Error).message; } } onMounted(async () => { try { if (staffSession.value?.user.role === "admin") stores.value = (await listStores()).filter((store) => store.active); await load(); } catch (reason) { error.value = (reason as Error).message; } });</script><template><section><header><div><p class="eyebrow">Operaciones</p><h1>Almacen <span class="count">{{ filtered.length }}</span></h1></div><RouterLink class="button-link" :to="{ name: 'inventory.create' }">Nuevo material</RouterLink></header><div class="filter-bar"><select v-if="staffSession?.user.role === 'admin'" v-model="storeId" @change="load"><option value="">Selecciona una tienda</option><option v-for="store in stores" :key="store.id" :value="store.id">{{ store.name }}</option></select><input v-model="query" placeholder="Buscar por SKU o nombre" /><RouterLink :to="{ name: 'inventory.alerts', query: storeId ? { storeId } : {} }">Ver alertas</RouterLink><RouterLink :to="{ name: 'suppliers.list' }">Proveedores</RouterLink><RouterLink :to="{ name: 'purchase-orders.list' }">Ordenes de compra</RouterLink></div><p v-if="error" class="feedback error">{{ error }}</p><div class="customer-list"><p v-if="!filtered.length" class="empty">No hay materiales registrados.</p><RouterLink v-else v-for="item in filtered" :key="item.id" class="customer-row" :to="{ name: 'inventory.detail.general', params: { id: item.id } }"><strong>{{ item.name }}</strong><span>{{ item.sku }}</span><span>{{ item.stock }} {{ item.unit }}</span><span class="status-pill">Min. {{ item.minimumStock }}</span></RouterLink></div></section></template>